Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.88,0:00:20.92,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,I feel like I can do anything right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.89,0:00:26.51,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,I'm really really excited, Yuki-chan!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.80,0:00:29.50,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,Sumomo, there it is! The star drop!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.35,0:00:31.10,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,Yes!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.42,0:00:36.76,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}It happened in the town closest to the stars.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.60,0:00:40.80,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}A very treasured story that only the two of them knew. {A very treasured story that only the two of them knew. - megu}{"Just two" or "Just the two" ? -Xien}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.41,0:00:44.74,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}Now, where should I begin first? {"Now, where should I start first?" - sounds better - megu}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:32.31,0:02:36.25,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}The story started after school one day, in the month of May.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:37.44,0:02:41.73,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}I was taking my time thinking about the things I was told.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:41.73,0:02:48.78,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,Hey Tsuwabuki, I know you're bad at socializing... {Wouldn't it be 'you're' ? It seems more suitable, but it's just me. -Xien}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.05,0:02:56.12,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,Can't you try getting along better with everyone in class? {Can't you try getting along better with everyone in class? - megu}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.00,0:02:59.49,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}Even if you say that...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.01,0:03:01.90,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}What should I do?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.57,0:03:16.00,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,Umm...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.25,0:03:19.98,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}That was the start of everything. {There's more than one beginning? [Actually, doesn't the prelude of a story = the beginning?][It could be, "That was the prelude to the story." -Xien}{That was the start of everything. -original was too wordy - megu}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.17,0:03:32.84,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}At that time, she had just transferred so I couldn't even remember her last name.{surname.}{Can't = couldn't? Or am I missing}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.81,0:03:37.07,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,It's cold.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.43,0:03:39.95,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,Y-You're all wet.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.65,0:03:42.58,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,S-Sorry...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.82,0:03:54.48,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,Umm...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.13,0:03:58.22,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,What happened, Sumomo? Are you crying?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.39,0:04:07.94,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,I will never forgive someone who makes Sumomo cry!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.28,0:04:10.62,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,Nako-chan, wait!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.87,0:04:16.49,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,Well, well...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.32,0:04:20.67,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,Oh my, what an interesting combination.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.21,0:04:26.66,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,Akihime-san is close to tears, Yaeno-san is angry and Tsuwabuki-kun is here too.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.99,0:04:30.11,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,That's because he made Sumomo cry.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.01,0:04:32.68,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,That's not it, Nako-chan.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.12,0:04:35.12,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,Tsuwabuki-kun didn't do anything wrong.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.39,0:04:39.89,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,S-Sorry. I'm sorry!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.41,0:04:41.46,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,Sumomo?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.46,0:04:43.48,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,It's fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.48,0:04:45.43,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,It's alright, so...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.72,0:04:46.64,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,Hmm... I see!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.91,0:04:50.41,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,Well then, perfect timing.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.41,0:04:52.70,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,Perfect timing?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.70,0:05:05.70,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,Anyway, one of the basics of gardening is pulling out the weeds. {Anyway, one of the basics of gardening is pulling out the weeds. - megu}{looks like pulling weeds is the basic of gardening according to Kisaragi -oneil}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.47,0:05:09.85,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,This way, the sweet smelling May flowers are taken care of...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.59,0:05:13.03,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,Doing this gives you a nice feeling, doesn't it? {Doing this gives a nice feeling, doesn't it? - megu}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.12,0:05:16.29,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,Not that! {This doesn't feel right. How about, "Not at all" ? -Xien}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.98,0:05:20.15,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,Kisaragi-sensei, why did it come to this? {original: Teacher Kisaragi}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.15,0:05:25.15,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,Well, the Gardening Club only has two members. Akihime-san and Yaeno-san.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.15,0:05:29.06,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,That's right. Yaeno-san, can you hand that thing to Tsuwabuki-kun?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.06,0:05:29.83,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.83,0:05:30.97,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,Hey...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.97,0:05:34.96,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,You just came at the right time when we needed more people.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.96,0:05:35.99,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,Don't tell me...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.77,0:05:40.63,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,You are going to use this to lure me over to the Gardening Club?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.63,0:05:44.36,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,Just as expected, Tsuwabuki-kun. Good decision.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.36,0:05:48.50,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,Well then, I'll leave everything to you, the only male member.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.56,0:05:49.84,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,See ya.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.86,0:05:50.94,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,See ya... what?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.94,0:05:52.53,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,Tsuwabuki, here.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.01,0:05:56.10,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,The sprinkler framework.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.25,0:06:08.56,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,Tsuwabuki-kun, we've been in the new class for more than a month now...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.00,0:06:13.47,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,Excluding us, you've never talked to anyone else before, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.27,0:06:16.71,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,Everyone is worried, you know.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.71,0:06:19.14,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,Are you even listening, Tsuwabuki?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.80,0:06:24.96,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,About just now, Nako-chan...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.96,0:06:28.12,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,I dropped the watering pot when I bumped into him.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.12,0:06:33.67,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,Then I got surprised at Tsuwabuki-kun getting wet. And then, and then...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.16,0:06:36.22,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,I understand, Sumomo.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.22,0:06:36.87,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.01,0:06:40.68,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,Thank goodness, Nako-chan.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.75,0:06:50.97,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,Wah, it's finished. This is great, really great, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.97,0:06:51.58,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.58,0:06:53.42,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,He really did it.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.63,0:06:55.64,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,So where is Tsuwabuki now?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.09,0:07:01.66,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,I guess being in the Gardening Club's pretty tough too. {I guess being in the Gardening Club's pretty tough too. - megu}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.05,0:07:04.27,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,It would be hard for just two girls.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.86,0:07:08.92,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,Eh, so I'll be a Gardening Club member, just like that? {Eh, so I'll be a Gardening Club member, just like that? - megu} {From what I understood from the line in the episode, I came up with "Wait, at this rate I'll really become a member of the club." Again, it's just me. Also, one can't become the Gardening club by oneself; else wouldn't be much of a club. -Xien}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.06,0:07:17.15,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,H-Hey you!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.15,0:07:19.47,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,Step aside, please step aside!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.51,0:07:27.02,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,I'm really sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.65,0:07:30.69,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,Are you hurt anywhere?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.69,0:07:32.01,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,I'm fine but...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.94,0:07:34.38,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,Are those ears?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.79,0:07:36.03,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,Uwah!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.27,0:07:41.21,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,Err... this is cosplay, yes just cosplay.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.30,0:07:44.70,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,Cos... what?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.81,0:07:47.00,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,Here, I believe this is yours.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.42,0:07:49.48,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,I'll return it to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.07,0:07:52.38,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,Now, please excuse me!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.54,0:07:56.07,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,What was that all about?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.88,0:08:13.23,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,Huh? What? Hey, what the...?! {..I really want to remove the 'are' from this line. I'm correct that it actually was "are", right? The thing is, "Are" is a word in English, so... - Waku}{I agree. -Xien}{It could also be "that" in Japanese. Though.. to make it easier for all of us, just remove it. OR replace it with "Hey", so it would be "Huh, hey, What?" - megu}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.36,0:08:21.77,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,Wah, this is so cute. { I think we should put '`š' at the end, just because. Nipah`š -Xien}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.77,0:08:23.12,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,Why is it here?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.49,0:08:27.84,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,Did someone forget it here or was it thrown away?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.36,0:08:30.17,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,I feel bad for you.  {The original sounds better. - megu}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.17,0:08:31.52,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,What, what is this?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.32,0:08:33.05,Nanatsuiro[Default2],,0000,0000,0000,,You don't have to worry, alright?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.72,0:08:34.11,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,Huh, Akihime?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.11,0:08:36.23,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,I'll bring you home.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.23,0:08:37.94,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,Eh? W-What?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.94,0:08:40.29,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,What a cute little doll.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.21,0:08:44.63,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,Sumomo, is Tsuwabuki here?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.31,0:08:47.35,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,No, I didn't see him anywhere.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.29,0:08:49.59,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,Wait for a moment, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.83,0:08:53.03,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,I'm looking for a friend named Tsuwabuki-kun.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.03,0:08:54.49,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,I'll be back soon.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.29,0:08:57.57,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,No, I'm right here.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.14,0:09:00.90,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,Is this a dream? What the hell is happening?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.57,0:09:07.36,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,"What the hell is happening?" indeed. {Kisaragi isn't really mocking him, right? Ah well. I'm placing quotation marks around the quote anyway. - megu}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.99,0:09:09.25,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,K-Kisaragi-sensei!{Teacher Kisaragi!}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.69,0:09:15.00,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,To think that the one who would receive the fate of the stars is this mysterious. {... "Who would receive the fate ..." ? -Xien}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.93,0:09:22.35,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,W-Wait a second!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.35,0:09:24.66,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,What are you going to do?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.82,0:09:28.48,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,You don't have to worry, Tsuwabuki-kun.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.26,0:09:31.93,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,That's easy for you to say...{The latter sounds better. - megu}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.03,0:09:39.86,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,Here, it won't hurt so...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.05,0:09:41.24,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,Uwahh!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.24,0:09:46.49,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,W-W-Wait a second...!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.21,0:09:48.99,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,There you go.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.99,0:09:51.86,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,Now you should be able to talk and move normally.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.78,0:09:54.00,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,Ah!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.00,0:09:57.34,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,You're right. I can speak!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.34,0:09:58.60,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,I can move!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.60,0:10:00.95,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,So, Tsuwabuki-kun...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.79,0:10:04.51,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,You must have drank a juice that was dropped from somewhere, didn't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.56,0:10:08.76,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,Huh? I wouldn't do such a thing...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.76,0:10:11.52,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,Wait... Just now, I bumped into a weird guy and then...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.05,0:10:13.81,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,That's it.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.65,0:10:17.78,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,That must be the reason why you transformed.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.19,0:10:21.82,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,That guy is someone from Figurare. {Oughta check the spelling for this... - megu}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.00,0:10:23.38,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,Figu- what?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.08,0:10:29.23,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,Figu-ra-re. It is another world different than our world of Retroscena.  {Ditto. - megu}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.23,0:10:33.40,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,And in that world, transformation is a normal phenomenon.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.40,0:10:34.76,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,Transformation.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.76,0:10:35.34,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.04,0:10:40.56,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,Which means you drank the Figurare traveler's transformation potion.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.56,0:10:41.84,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,Do you understand...?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.42,0:10:44.00,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,Guess not.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.41,0:10:45.95,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,Of course not! {Changed from "Of course!". Matter of negatives. - Waku}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.95,0:10:48.25,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,There's no way I'd believe that Figura-whatever...{No way I'll believe that Figu or whatever- }{I think Yuki-chan's supposed to say "Figu or whatever-" there, since he might be referring to Figuraare. - megu}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.26,0:10:49.60,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,Come in.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.60,0:10:50.81,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,Excuse me.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.36,0:10:56.01,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,Kisaragi-sensei, we couldn’t find Tsuwabuki-kun anywhere. {original: Teacher Kisaragi}{Cannot or Could not ? -Xien} {I’d go with “couldn’t”. – megu}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.01,0:11:00.47,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,Oh, he said he had some business to do so he went home earlier.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.47,0:11:01.81,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.38,0:11:03.88,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,Looking for him about something?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.43,0:11:09.09,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah. He finished setting up the sprinkler so we wanted to say thanks. {Removed the 'Yes' and changed it to 'Hai`' because simply saying 'yes' took out the cuteness.}{Personally, I don’t think so. It’s up to the others to decide though. – megu}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.09,0:11:13.58,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,And there was a little misunderstanding earlier, so...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.01,0:11:17.63,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,Why don't you do that tomorrow then?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.63,0:11:20.13,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,It's getting dark now, so you both should head back too.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.13,0:11:21.35,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.08,0:11:29.61,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,Umm, did you see a doll? A cute little sheep.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.61,0:11:33.14,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,Hmm, I don't think so.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.14,0:11:35.15,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,I see. Goodbye.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.14,0:11:44.16,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,Well then, I'll tell you how to return to your old self.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.16,0:11:47.29,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,Huh? I can return to my old self? Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.29,0:11:48.19,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,Of course.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.87,0:11:53.20,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,However, a sheep like you wouldn't be able to do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.67,0:11:57.56,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,I wonder what kind of destiny is waiting for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.20,0:12:27.71,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,Today, I talked a lot with Tsuwabuki-kun.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:42.63,0:12:44.14,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,It's Doll-chan! {Minor capitalization. -megu}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:46.80,0:12:50.55,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,Thank goodness, I thought I'd never see you again.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.55,0:12:52.65,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,What a strange doll.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.98,0:12:54.18,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,This is...?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.21,0:12:57.73,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,Why? Why did it have to be Akihime? {Why? Why did it have to be Akihime? - megu}{AIko:lol he got the air head....}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.38,0:12:57.33,Nanatsuiro[Default2],,0000,0000,0000,,It looks like a letter.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.54,0:13:00.11,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,Maybe it got stuck.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.38,0:13:05.11,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,Tsuwabuki-kun, I'm going to tell you how to return to your old self so...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.33,0:13:10.03,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,you can tell your soon-to-be-chosen girl partner about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.87,0:13:15.28,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,To begin with, this town is said to be the town nearest...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.48,0:13:22.02,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,Now, Tsuwabuki-kun.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:22.02,0:13:25.16,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,, That ring will bring you to the chosen girl.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.89,0:13:27.26,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,Hey, wait!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:27.26,0:13:30.06,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,I will send you to your Stellar Spinear. {I'm sure about the Spinia part. But the other word.... - megu} {Star spinner? -Xien}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.46,0:13:31.59,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,Have a nice trip!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.59,0:13:34.74,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,Wait! Wait a second!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.88,0:13:39.31,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,Why? Why did the girl have to be Akihime?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.31,0:13:43.52,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,Hmm... "I'm a special doll." {Needs rewording. -Xien}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:43.52,0:13:47.40,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,"Due to certain circumstances, I cannot go back to my home."
Dialogue: 0,0:13:47.40,0:13:49.78,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,"For me to return to the doll land,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:49.78,0:13:51.98,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,I will need your power."
Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.98,0:13:53.35,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,"If it's fine with you,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:53.35,0:13:56.03,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,please take care of and help save me."
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.60,0:13:58.00,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,What's that supposed to mean?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:59.16,0:14:02.00,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,It talked, and it's moving too.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.30,0:14:11.80,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,Yay! This is great!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.80,0:14:14.50,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,It really is a special Doll-chan.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.29,0:14:19.06,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,I'm Akihime Sumomo. What is your name?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.34,0:14:21.06,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,Tsuwa-
Dialogue: 0,0:14:21.44,0:14:22.67,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,Tsuwabuki-kun.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.67,0:14:27.40,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,In order for you to change back, you mustn't tell anybody your real identity.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.56,0:14:29.13,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,If someone finds out...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.30,0:14:32.02,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,None, I have no name!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.27,0:14:34.77,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,Is that so?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.77,0:14:36.05,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.26,0:14:39.04,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}That was really close.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.04,0:14:41.82,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}If my identity is known, I won't be able to return to my old self.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:43.77,0:14:46.75,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,Umm, hey, what's the matter?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.88,0:14:49.70,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.70,0:14:51.94,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,Not having a name...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.94,0:14:55.47,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,There must be a reason to it, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.49,0:15:03.02,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,I know! You're white, small and light, so... Yuki-chan.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.03,0:15:05.56,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,From now on, you'll be Yuki-chan.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.72,0:15:08.65,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,So I'm Yuki-chan, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:08.65,0:15:15.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an8\3c&H985443&\shad0\fnLacuna Regular\fs22}Note:"Ore" is considered a more manly and commanding way of referring to one's self as opposed to "Boku".
Dialogue: 0,0:15:08.65,0:15:12.55,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,Hey, not 'Ore' but 'Boku' right? {ore sounds more 'I'm in charge'-ish} {Probably add a TL note here about the Ore/Boku usage. - megu}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.55,0:15:15.80,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,Just because you can't go home, you shouldn't act wild. {shouldn't become wild -> shouldn't be too bossy - megu}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.80,0:15:16.57,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,Act wild? {Above correction. - megu} {'Become wild' sounds weird, how about 'Run wild' ? -Xien}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.66,0:15:18.85,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,Yuki-chan.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.85,0:15:20.67,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,I'll do my best...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:20.67,0:15:23.19,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,So you can go back home.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.19,0:15:24.22,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,T-That's fine with you?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.22,0:15:27.48,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,Well, you need my help right?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.48,0:15:29.41,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,So what should I do?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:30.66,0:15:32.05,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,Well, for me to return...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.28,0:15:33.69,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,Use 'Boku'!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.43,0:15:36.58,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,For me to return...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.69,0:15:40.85,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,There are seven star drops. {Sounds iffy."There are seven star drops." - megu}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.85,0:15:42.78,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,Star drops?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:42.78,0:15:47.33,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,The star drops can only be gathered by the chosen girl.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.78,0:15:49.82,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,And that's me?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:51.01,0:15:52.31,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,Looks like it.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.73,0:15:55.92,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,So, I'm the chosen girl.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:56.22,0:15:59.14,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,What would happen if I fail...?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:59.14,0:16:03.15,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,No, I must let Yuki-chan go back home.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.15,0:16:05.33,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,I'll do my best, Yuki-chan.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:06.24,0:16:07.56,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.08,0:16:13.06,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}Akihime... she looks so different compared to when she's at school...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.66,0:16:16.34,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,Huh? That's right, the ring.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.17,0:16:19.02,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,A ring?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:22.66,0:16:25.62,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,Wow! This is great!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:25.62,0:16:29.70,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,When a star drop falls down, the ring will shine towards it.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.00,0:16:31.53,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,Guess it's real.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:31.53,0:16:33.29,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,Let's go, Yuki-chan.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:40.31,0:16:43.22,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,Hold on tight so you don't fall off, okay? {"Hold on tight so you don't fall off, okay?" ... ? -Xien}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.71,0:16:49.67,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,Umm...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:50.28,0:16:51.71,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,Use the ring!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.71,0:16:52.99,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,Oh, right!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.85,0:17:00.22,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,So that is a star drop?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.93,0:17:07.18,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,It's going to drop near my school.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.16,0:17:16.42,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,I wonder where it dropped at, Yuki-chan.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:16.42,0:17:18.45,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,Umm...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:18.45,0:17:22.85,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,Oh yeah! The star drop likes to drop somewhere that has pretty water.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.85,0:17:24.08,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,Water?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:31.70,0:17:32.73,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,It should be here.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.87,0:17:36.90,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,But what's happening here?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:36.90,0:17:42.01,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,This fountain's supposed to be old and there shouldn't be water flowing out of it anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:43.27,0:17:44.67,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,So that is the drop.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:46.73,0:17:48.85,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,But that looks deep.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:49.28,0:17:54.04,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,It isn't supposed to be this deep. I can't reach it.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.46,0:18:10.40,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,Yay, this is great!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:10.51,0:18:12.24,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,It's so great, so great! {Repetitive, needs rewording.}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.24,0:18:14.24,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,It's just like magic!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:14.24,0:18:20.04,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,If you don't hurry, the star drop will melt into the water!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:21.22,0:18:23.05,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,Oh no!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:27.75,0:18:30.38,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,I can't reach it at all, Yuki-chan.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:30.38,0:18:32.43,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,That's right, words!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:32.66,0:18:34.72,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,It's because we're not reading the detachment words.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:40.70,0:18:43.05,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,What... are these...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:43.42,0:18:44.69,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,...characters?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:47.19,0:18:49.37,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,This part shows the Japanese characters. {This part shows the Japanese characters. - megu}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:49.85,0:18:51.89,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,Those blue characters are...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:52.77,0:18:53.46,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,That's... 'pu'!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:53.92,0:18:56.97,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,Next is 'ru'... 'vu'...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:56.97,0:18:59.48,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,And then...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.40,0:19:01.46,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,I think that's 'ra'.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:01.46,0:19:02.75,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,Eh?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:02.75,0:19:08.09,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,And then 'de', 'i', no... it's a small 'i'.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.97,0:19:14.88,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,{\fs28\fnCalligraph421 BT\3c&H985443&}Pu-ru-vu Ra-di!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:19.11,0:19:20.28,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,We have to catch up to it! {Leave it with the we omitted? -Xien}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:21.02,0:19:22.44,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,Wait!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:25.48,0:19:26.95,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,Are you okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:28.37,0:19:32.83,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,I was worried that I'd step on the flowers, so I fell.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:32.83,0:19:33.88,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:34.46,0:19:36.30,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,The star drop...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:38.04,0:19:39.52,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:41.14,0:19:42.23,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,Where did...?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:53.01,0:19:56.54,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,The star drop disappeared.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:56.85,0:19:59.09,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,I'm sorry, Yuki-chan.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:59.09,0:20:00.26,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,I'm not...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:02.60,0:20:08.38,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,Well, umm... it likes water so how about spraying some water?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:08.38,0:20:10.68,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,Use the sprinkler that we built today!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:10.68,0:20:11.52,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,Today?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:13.12,0:20:14.45,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,Whoops...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:14.85,0:20:17.54,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,I see, that sprinkler!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:32.35,0:20:33.47,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,There it is!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:41.84,0:20:44.26,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,Wow, it's pretty!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:45.75,0:20:48.21,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,Alright, this time I'll do it!  {Alright, this time I'll do it! - megu}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:48.21,0:20:50.98,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,But it didn't work too well even with the words, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:50.98,0:20:54.27,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,It must be because I was trying to get it from a difficult place.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:54.27,0:20:55.83,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,Let's go, Yuki-chan!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:03.82,0:21:05.81,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,{\fs28\fnCalligraph421 BT\3c&H985443&}Puruvu Radi!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:14.87,0:21:16.44,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,We did it.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:16.60,0:21:17.89,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:18.96,0:21:20.30,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,So pretty.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:23.04,0:21:25.26,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,Put it inside the glass flask we brought.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:25.26,0:21:26.48,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:27.84,0:21:29.14,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,Done.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:32.79,0:21:34.34,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,Yay!{This is great!}{... We could shorten it to 'Wow!' .. -Xien}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:34.34,0:21:36.50,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,We did it, Yuki-chan!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:40.39,0:21:44.13,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,Miss, that girl must be her...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:46.92,0:21:50.78,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,Prima Palm, the one that will get in our way...{Prima pramu?}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:52.64,0:21:55.66,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,I won't hand over the star drops.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:01.41,0:22:03.37,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,That was fun.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:03.37,0:22:06.40,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,That was my first time doing something so fun and mysterious.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:06.53,0:22:09.29,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,My heart was beating so fast.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:09.77,0:22:10.94,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,Beating so fast...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:12.76,0:22:18.92,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,But Yuki-chan, how did you know about the sprinkler that Tsuwabuki-kun built today...?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:21.32,0:22:24.58,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,That's because... umm... err...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:26.55,0:22:27.40,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,I...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:37.95,0:22:40.41,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}The girl's name was Akihime Sumomo.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:41.78,0:22:45.67,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}And now, there were six star drops left.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:20.74,0:24:22.32,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,Speaking of rainy day memories... {Speaking of rainy day memories... - megu}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:22.51,0:24:23.74,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,You'd remember the person you shared an umbrella with.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:23.74,0:24:25.04,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,Ah, who is that?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:25.04,0:24:26.01,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,Who? Umm...
Dialogue: 0,0:24:26.01,0:24:26.61,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,Guess it's nobody.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:26.61,0:24:28.12,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,Ah... it's someone I admire.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:28.28,0:24:31.52,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,Hey, I want to share an umbrella with someone cute like Sumomo.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:31.52,0:24:32.82,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,Ahh. Well, that is...
Dialogue: 0,0:24:32.82,0:24:34.15,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,...impossible for you.
